Guandan DanZero model provenance notice
=======================================

The Guandan inference architecture and feature layout in this repository are
adapted from DanZero:

  Yudong Lu, Jian Zhao, Youpeng Zhao, Wengang Zhou, and Houqiang Li,
  "DanZero: Mastering GuanDan Game with Reinforcement Learning."
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.17087

The upstream DanZero code repository is AltmanD/guandan_mcc at commit
e816ca3af431678903d051365d7c19a6dd4ebdb8 and is distributed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:

  https://github.com/AltmanD/guandan_mcc
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The checkpoint used to produce guandan-dmc.bin was obtained from
submit-paper/Danzero_plus, actor_torch/q_network.ckpt, at commit
427decec14a877e28e4006aeb465e84a48a2fd70. That repository describes itself
as based on AltmanD/guandan_mcc but does not contain a standalone LICENSE file
as of the pinned commit. This notice therefore does not represent the
checkpoint itself as independently Apache-2.0 licensed. Its exact source and
hash are recorded in manifest.json so that provenance and redistribution risk
remain explicit.

Local changes include deterministic browser/Node inference, public-information
feature reconstruction, per-column int8 packing, and integration with this
site's rules engine. No new model was trained.
